cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Aeolus in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Aeolus: a Python toolkit for air quality data analysis"
abstract: >-
  Aeolus is an opinionated Python library for downloading, standardising and
  analysing air quality data from UK, European and international monitoring
  networks and global aggregation portals. It provides a unified 8-column
  pandas DataFrame schema, regulatory statistics, trend analysis, and
  openair-style temporal variation plots.
